## Sender Initialization Entry Point Analysis - ScreenFerry Codebase

Based on my thorough exploration of the ScreenFerry codebase at `/home/coding/screenferry`, I've identified the sender initialization entry points and relevant code sections. Here are my findings:

## 1. Sender Initialization Entry Points

### Primary Entry Point: `/home/coding/screenferry/src/platform/init.ts`

The main initialization function is **`runAppInit()`** (lines 38-133), which contains:

**Lines 44-91: Validation Insertion Point with Detailed Documentation**
```typescript
// ========================================
// VALIDATION INSERTION POINT (bf-1mj8, bf-ft40, bf-320a)
